* {{sense|give public notice}} {{l|en|make known}}, {{l|en|announce}}, {{l|en|proclaim}}, {{l|en|promulgate}}, {{qualifier|uncommon use}} {{l|en|publish}}, {{l|en|bill}}
* {{sense|advertise commercially}} {{l|en|promote}}, {{l|en|publicise}}, {{l|en|sell}}

