{{topics|en|Advertising}}

==English==

===Etymology===
{{PIE word|en|dwóh₁}}
{{etymon|en|:inh|enm:combinacioun<id:combination>|id=act of combining}}
From {{inh|en|enm|combinacioun}}, {{m|enm|combynacyoun}}, from {{der|en|fro|combination}}, from {{der|en|la-lat|combīnātiō}}. Morphologically {{suffix|en|combine|ation}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˌkɒmbɪˈneɪʃən/|a=RP}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˌkɑmbɪˈneɪʃən/|a=GA}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-combination.ogg|a=US}}
* {{rhymes|en|eɪʃən|s=4}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# The act of [[combining]], the state of being [[combined]] or the result of [[combining]].
#: {{co|en|'''combinations''' of colors}}
#: {{usex|en|These guidelines should be followed in '''combination''' with those given last week.}}
#: {{usex|en|She took a dangerous '''combination''' of alcohol and heroin.}}
# An object formed by [[combining]].
#: {{ux|en|The chef experimented with new flavor '''combinations'''.}}
#: {{ux|en|Certain drug '''combinations''' can be dangerous.}}
# A [[sequence]] of [[number]]s or [[letter]]s used to [[open]] a [[combination lock]].
#: {{usex|en|The '''combination''' to their safe was the date of birth of their first child.}}
# {{lb|en|mathematics}} One or more [[element]]s [[select]]ed from a [[set]] [[without]] [[regard]] to the [[order]] of [[selection]].
# An [[association]] or [[alliance]] of people for some [[common]] [[purpose]].
# {{lb|en|billiards}} A shot where the cue ball hits a ball that strikes another ball on the table.
#: {{syn|en|billiard|combination shot}}
# {{lb|en|motorcycle}} A [[motorcycle]] and [[sidecar]].
# {{lb|en|boxing|martial arts}} A rapid sequence of punches or strikes in boxing or other combat sports.
# {{lb|en|chess}} An advantageous sequence of forcing or nearly forcing moves, often initiated with a sacrifice.
# {{syn of|en|combinations}} (A one-piece suit of underwear).
# {{lb|en|England|Wales|archaic}} A local or regional [[league]] in [[association football]].
#: {{ux|en|The [[w:Lancashire Combination|Lancashire '''Combination''']].}}

====Synonyms====
