* {{sense|with the first element reduced to ''ha-'', ''ha’'', or ''hal-''}} {{alter|en|halpeny|halpenye|hapeney|hapenny|ha'penny|happenny}} {{qualifier|all obsolete except ''ha’penny''}}
* {{sense|with the first element altered to ''haw-''}} {{alter|en|hawpny}} {{qualifier|dialectal, obsolete}}

